email.body:
Hi {Owner},

I build websites and lead systems for real estate brokerages. {Business Name} has a strong team, but on a phone the listings search sits in a framed box, agent pages show no listings, and there's no page for agents thinking of joining.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting first: a listings search from your feed, agent profiles with their own listings, office pages, a recruiting page and an off-plan launch layout, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it fits, I finish it on your domain for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, feed monitoring and edits. Enquiries route straight to the right agent. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Would thirty minutes with you and your marketing lead be worth it?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
